<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 25.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 25.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Raadio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- Former Parliament member Ulo Uluots, who died of a long illness, will be buried today.</p>
<p>- Sacked Tallinn police prefect Aivar Toompere said he will sue Interior Minister Robert Lepikson. He demands that the minister cancel the decree by which he was sacked.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
